---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Thread Stash Privacy Policy | Caracara Software"
  description="Privacy Policy for Thread Stash, a local-first thread inventory app by Caracara Software."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-[#080b12] relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
      <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[420px] h-[420px] rounded-full opacity-10 translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/3"
        style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #6366f1 0%, transparent 70%);"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[420px] h-[420px] rounded-full opacity-10 -translate-x-1/3 translate-y-1/3"
        style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #22d3ee 0%, transparent 70%);"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-indigo-500"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-indigo-400">
          Thread Stash
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0f1420] p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-indigo-400 mb-4">
          Privacy Policy
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-4">
          Privacy Policy for <span class="gradient-text">Thread Stash</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Thread Stash is designed to help you manage your thread inventory and project needs while
          keeping your data primarily on your own device.
        </p>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-5 py-4 mb-10">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            <span class="font-semibold text-white">Effective date:</span> May 6, 2026
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-300 leading-7">
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. Summary</h2>
            <p>
              Thread Stash is a local-first mobile app. Information you enter into the app, such as
              your inventory, projects, and related thread details, is stored locally on your
              device.
            </p>
            <p>
              We do not require you to create an account to use Thread Stash, and we do not sell
              your personal information.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. Information the app handles</h2>
            <p>Depending on how you use Thread Stash, the app may handle:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-400">
              <li>thread inventory details you enter</li>
              <li>project names, notes, and thread requirements you enter</li>
              <li>photos you take for thread scanning</li>
              <li>text recognized from those photos to help identify thread numbers</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">3. How information is used</h2>
            <p>The app uses this information only to provide its features, including:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-400">
              <li>saving and organizing your thread inventory</li>
              <li>managing projects and shopping lists</li>
              <li>scanning thread labels from photos you choose to take</li>
              <li>extracting likely thread numbers from images you provide</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">4. Camera and photos</h2>
            <p>
              If you use the scanning feature, Thread Stash may request access to your device
              camera so you can take a photo of a thread label. If you do not grant camera access,
              you can still use the app’s manual entry features.
            </p>
            <p>
              Images you take for scanning are used to support recognition of thread numbers within
              the app experience.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">5. Storage and processing</h2>
            <p>
              Thread Stash is designed so that your inventory and project data are stored locally on
              your device.
            </p>
            <p>
              Text recognition for the scan flow is used only to support the app’s functionality.
              If your device or platform provider handles any part of that processing, it is also
              subject to that provider’s own policies.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">6. Data sharing</h2>
            <p>
              We do not sell your personal information. We do not intentionally collect or share
              your thread inventory, project data, or photos with Caracara Software except as
              required to make platform features work on your device.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">7. Data retention</h2>
            <p>
              Your data remains on your device until you edit or delete it, remove the app, or your
              device removes it.
            </p>
            <p>
              Device-level backup services provided by Apple, Google, or other platform providers
              may back up app data according to your settings and those providers’ policies.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">8. Your choices</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-400">
              <li>edit or delete thread and project information in the app</li>
              <li>delete individual projects or thread requirements from projects</li>
              <li>deny camera permissions through your device settings</li>
              <li>delete the app to remove locally stored app data from your device</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">9. Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>
              We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the
              effective date shown above.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">10. Contact</h2>
            <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact:</p>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5 text-slate-300">
              <p class="font-semibold text-white">Caracara Software</p>
              <p>
                <a
                  href="mailto:caracara.software@gmail.com"
                  class="text-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-200 transition-colors duration-200"
                >
                  caracara.software@gmail.com
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
